base_widget"></div></a><div class="submission_summary"><div class="sub">Submitted</div><a href="/jam/viprpg-gw-2026/rate/4572243">真・偽ムシャがミリンかけられる</a></div></div><div class="post_footer"><a data-register_action="community_vote" class="post_action vote_btn" href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-gw-2026%2Frate%2F4611817&amp;intent=community"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a data-register_action="community_reply" href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-gw-2026%2Frate%2F4611817&amp;intent=community" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies top_level_replies"><div data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:9540264,&quot;id&quot;:16450071}" class="community_post is_reply" id="post-16450071"><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/romra"><div style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI1MzA3Njk0LmdpZg==/original/CFoVHT.gif)" class="post_avatar"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/romra">moya</a></span><span class="author_flag owner" data-slug="developer">Developer</span><span class="post_date" title="2026-06-30 04:28:04"><a href="/post/16450071">112 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"><span class="upvotes">(+1)</span></span></div><div class="post_content"><div dir="auto" class="post_body user_formatted"><p>クリスタのような256色カラーパレット出力に対応してない画像編集ソフトを使う時に特に便利ですねえ</p>
